    n75 [label="n75: The combination of an elderly patient, unilateral nasal cavity mass, extension into the choana/nasopharynx, ipsilateral maxillary sinus involvement, and local bony erosion or remodeling most strongly supports inverted papilloma over a simple antrochoanal polyp.\\n[causal]", fillcolor="#c8e6c9"];
